<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>请求参数有误</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body data-csucampuscraft-app="user">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container site-header-inner">
        <a class="site-brand" href="/" aria-label="CSUCampusCraft 首页">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">CSU</span>
            <span>CSUCampusCraft 用户端</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="站点导航">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span class="app-label">用户端</span>
            <span class="nav-placeholder" aria-label="购物车，0 件">
                购物车 <span id="cart-quantity" class="quantity-badge"
                           data-cart-quantity="0">0</span>
            </span>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="container global-alerts" aria-label="全局提示区">
    
    
    

</div>
<main id="main-content" class="container main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="panel error-page" aria-labelledby="error-title" data-error-status="400">
    <p class="error-number">400</p>
    <h1 id="error-title">请求参数有误</h1>
    <p>请选择允许的选项。</p>
    <p class="muted">返回原表单修正输入，或回到首页继续浏览。</p>
    <p class="error-code">错误代码：<span>INVALID_ENUM</span></p>
    <section class="alert alert-danger" aria-label="字段提示">
        <ul><li>请选择允许的选项。</li></ul>
    </section>
    <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <span>CSUCampusCraft 校园文创商城</span>
        <span class="muted">课程实验 · 教学模拟</span>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
